	(text_box "Note:\n-----\nMoved from Adafruite Feather nRF52840 Sense\nLoRa_RST - PIN9 - D9 (P0.26 | HS)\n\nTo -> P0.03_A1_D1\n----\nMoved from Adafruite Feather nRF52840 Sense\nLoRa_DIO1 - PIN5 - D5 (P1.08 | HS)\n\nTo -> P0.28_A2_D2\n----\nMoved from Adafruite Feather nRF52840 Sense\nLoRa_DIO2 - PIN6 - D6 (P0.07 | HS)\n\nTo -> P0.29_A3_D3\n----\nMoved from Adafruite Feather nRF52840 Sense\nLoRa_CS - PIN10 - D10 (P0.27 | HS) (New Name: NSS)\n\nTo ->  P1.03_D17_SCK1\n----\nMoved from Adafruite Feather nRF52840 Sense\nLoRa_IRQ - PIN11 - D11 (P0.06 | HS) (New Name: DIO0)\n\nTo -> P015_D11_I2S_SD\n----\n\nMoved from Adafruite Feather nRF52840 Sense\nBuzzer - PIN12 - D12 (P0.08 | HS)\n\nTo -> P0.02_A0_D0 (Vorherige Iteration - Stand Mo., 8.6.: P1.12_D7_RX)\n----\n\nMoved from Adafruite Feather nRF52840 Sense\nVibration - PIN13 - D13 (P1.09 | HS)\n\nTo -> P0.10_D15_NTX1 (Vorherige Iteration - Stand Mo., 8.6.: P1.11_D6_TX)\n----\n\nMoved from Adafruite Feather nRF52840 Sense\nTHUMBSTICK\n\nTMB2 - PINA0 - A0 (P0.04 | HS) To -> P0.09_D14_NFC1_RX1 (Vorherige Iteration: P0.10_D15_NFC_TX1)\nTMBT1 - PINA1 - A1 (P0.30 | HS) To -> P1.01_D13_I2S_WS\nTMB1 - PINA3 - A3 (P0.28 | HS) To -> P0.19_D12_I2S_SCK\n----"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
